OL,3,GNEWSACommunity laments 'terribly sad'
OL,4,Atheatre closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPerformers and show goers across
OL,7,FCornwall have said they were
OL,8,F"devastated" to learn about the closure
OL,9,Fof a community theatre.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, Sterts Theatre CIC said
OL,12,Fit would be placed into creditors'
OL,13,Fvoluntary liquidation amid an
OL,14,F"exceptionally challenging time for
OL,15,Fcultural and arts organisations".
OL,17,FNicky Brice, former ballet teacher at
OL,18,Fthe theatre at Upton Cross on the edge
OL,19,Fof Bodmin Moor, said it was a "huge
OL,20,Floss" for the area.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
