OL,3,GNEWSACommunity laments 'terribly sad'
OL,4,Atheatre closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer trustee, Ali Fenn, said she was
OL,7,F"very saddened" by the closure, adding
OL,8,Fit had been a "fantastic asset in south
OL,9,Feast Cornwall" for young people.
